    <string name="canta_description">Canta is an open source uninstaller app that uses Shizuku to remove system and user apps.\nIt allows you to debloat your device as you wish, no PC required.\n\nSpecial thanks to %1$s.\nCanta would\'t be the same without their work.</string>
